### 版本说明 / Version Note:
- 本次更新为大版本更新
  This update is a major version release

### 修复内容 / Fixes:
- 修复中文列表页面标题栏品牌链接跳转问题
  Fixed brand link navigation issue in Chinese list pages' title bar
  - 更新了以下页面的品牌链接：
    Updated brand links in the following pages:
    - public/news/list.html
    - public/news/list-tlz.html
    - public/news/list-360reality.html
    - public/news/list-ssdjy.html
  - 将错误的相对路径 href="index.html" 修正为 href="../index.html"
    Corrected incorrect relative path href="index.html" to href="../index.html"

### 新功能 / New Features:
- 为列表页面添加动画效果
  Added animation effects to list pages
  - 添加了 fadeIn 和模糊效果的组合动画
    Added combined fadeIn and blur animations
  - 为导航栏项目添加了序列动画
    Added sequential animations to navbar items
  - 为列表项添加了延迟加载动画
    Added staggered loading animations to list items
  - 为返回按钮添加了动画效果
    Added animations to back buttons
  - 影响页面：所有列表页面 (list*.html)
    Affected pages: All list pages (list*.html)

